{"uid":"ebfd76ed483db033","name":"test_a_hub_cached_index_is_refused_after_an_out_of_window_rewrite","fullName":"tests.test_hub_real_render_cap_whole_call#test_a_hub_cached_index_is_refused_after_an_out_of_window_rewrite","historyId":"589ca03cb2fee191dd452ec34edad33f","time":{"start":1791921596105,"stop":1791921596737,"duration":632},"description":"Task cure-01-01-4 criterion (2), cached indexes: an iteration with\n    NO on-disk render index has its index built and cached by the hub\n    (`ui_server._ABSENT_INDEX_CACHE`, keyed by iteration number and the\n    transcript's own identity witness). A same-size rewrite of a\n    non-leading, out-of-window covered line leaves the size unchanged\n    (still visible through `latest_iteration_cache_key`) yet moves the\n    mtime, so the cached index's own witness no longer holds:\n    `bounded_tail(..., index=cached)` refuses it, and the next call on\n    both surfaces answers the exact full-render 'alpha' instead of the\n    cached, stale 'kept'.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task cure-01-01-4 criterion (2), cached indexes: an iteration with<br />\nNO on-disk render index has its index built and cached by the hub<br />\n(<code>ui_server._ABSENT_INDEX_CACHE</code>, keyed by iteration number and the<br />\ntranscript's own identity witness). A same-size rewrite of a<br />\nnon-leading, out-of-window covered line leaves the size unchanged<br />\n(still visible through <code>latest_iteration_cache_key</code>) yet moves the<br />\nmtime, so the cached index's own witness no longer holds:<br />\n<code>bounded_tail(..., index=cached)</code> refuses it, and the next call on<br />\nboth surfaces answers the exact full-render 'alpha' instead of the<br />\ncached, stale 'kept'.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791921596088,"stop":1791921596088,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":